Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.25,0:03:02.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦，她那工作还真辛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.76,0:03:07.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别吵醒美里小姐，安静点、安静点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嘘——
