Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.06,0:03:20.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我正在换衣服，你们敢偷看的话就等死吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}少臭美了，白痴
