Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.16,0:03:28.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自我意识过重的家伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.01,0:03:33.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}打、打、打、打…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，欢迎你们来呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.79,0:03:40.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你回来了，今晚有精神共振试验
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.21,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可别迟到哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.43,0:03:42.71,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明日香也听到了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.24,0:03:45.89,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是——
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.51,0:03:52.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哇！恭喜您荣获晋升
