Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.25,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哪里，您多礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，我先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.52,0:04:02.11,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}您走好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.47,0:04:06.07,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么了？美里有什么事发生吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.68,0:04:09.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐领子上的军衔呀，变成两条线的了
