Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.50,0:04:14.39,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我都不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.16,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她什么时候…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.30,0:04:19.64,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是真的不知道吧，可怜的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.97,0:04:24.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难道你们就没有那种关心别人的心吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.09,0:04:29.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人家那么年轻就得带着你们两个中学生
