Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.17,0:05:27.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣，你做的很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.11,0:05:28.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.77,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}精神共振值比上次上升了 8 点
