Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.92,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]接下来是住在第 2 东京市的窪君来的信息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.76,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]但是怎么说呢？是个被女孩子甩了，有些懦弱放不开的孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.50,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]我从小在这方面（交异性朋友）就是空白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.13,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]每天都过着平平常常的日子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.62,0:06:09.34,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]对自己喜欢的人这类事情想也没想过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.03,0:06:13.30,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]现在双亲也健在，衣食无忧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.90,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]这个已经是谢天谢地的事情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.50,0:06:25.02,Radio,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}{\a1}[Radio]现在你正在咀嚼着幸福，处在一个非常好的时代，明白吗？窪君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这个我明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.00,0:06:08.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我刚才被夸奖时也不怎么高兴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还好像惹明日香生气了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.57,0:06:14.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她为什么会生气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.30,0:06:17.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是我做错了什么吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.49,0:06:20.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还在意刚才的事
