Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是我邀请的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.88,0:06:59.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}丽呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我有邀请她的，真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过她真难打交道呢
