Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.53,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持先生真得那么帅吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}和坐在这里的这些地瓜相比简直是天壤之别
