Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.66,0:07:18.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}再说一遍试试
