Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.06,0:07:40.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也就是说美里小姐得到别人的肯定了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯，大概是这样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.26,0:07:45.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以大家才会这么高兴吧
