Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.11,0:07:51.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也不是说完全不高兴，还是有一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.82,0:07:54.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，这不是我在这里的目的
